you  flow go with the flow it's not just an  expression it's a powerful way of living  it'll make you a better entrepreneur and  a better person when you try to force  something you don't get amazing results  on monday night I had an idea for my  business so I did what I usually do i  emailed myself the idea so I wouldn't  forget it and I continue with my day  after all it was past midnight and I  should be getting ready for bed but I  was feeling this idea I worried that if  I tackled it tomorrow I wouldn't have  the same energy or enthusiasm for it the  next steps wouldn't be as clear as they  were to me right now because i was in  flow so i pushed off bedtime sat back  down on my laptop and got to work and it  was great i finished the whole plan  drafted two documents and recorded two  videos i looked up and it was two thirty  in the morning I didn't even know where  the time went but I managed to do in two  and a half hours what normally would  have taken me two days the end product  was also better than it would have been  if I worked on it the next day it had  more passion it was something special  because it was created when I was in  flow pay attention to your flow I have  one of the most structured schedules of  anyone I know on Mondays i right on  Wednesdays I do videos on thursdays i  take meetings my days are split up into  one and a half hour chunks of time and  everything is accounted for unless i get  into flow flow changes everything when I  get into a state of flow I keep working  I blow through deadlines I push off  other responsibilities because what you  create when you're in flow is so  incredibly valuable that everything else  is secondary flow is rare flows a funny  thing you can have it for an hour or for  the whole day just like a baseball  hitter who's on a hot streak you can be  in flow for weeks but it'll disappear as  quickly as it came and you feel like  you're in a slump unsure what to do next  not motivated by your business anymore  forcing yourself to keep going capture  your flow so when flow does come to you  you  have to run with it it's critical it'll  help you make amazing things truly  wonderful special things what are you  worried about the other projects that  you have to do are slowly killing you  nothing impactful will ever come from  them so when flow comes right the way  for as long as you can you owe it to  yourself and your community believe

